/**
 * The fonts the office can choose for a poster's name and designation.
 * GENERATED by scripts/fetch-poster-fonts.mjs — edit that list, then re-run it.
 *
 * Plain data, no DOM: the panel, the renderer and the server (which only lets
 * these ids into a published poster) all read it.
 *
 * Each face is registered under its own family name ("THK …") so that it can
 * never collide with the website's own @font-face rules, and with every weight
 * mapped onto the one file, so the browser never fakes a bold of a face that
 * is already heavy.
 */

